      DO !","body":"\nPLAYER SPECIFIC :\n\n- SET CARDS BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n-
      SET CARDS COUNT BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n\nSHARED INBETWEEN PLAYERS :\n\n-
      When a card is played this round, ADD IT TO PLAYEDCARDSTHISROUND\n- When a
      card is played, ADD IT TO ALLPLAYEDCARDS\n- When a card is played, ADD IT TO
      CURRENTTRICKPLAYERCARDS with reference to the PLAYER\n- When a player is out
      of cards from a specific color, ADD A REFERENCE TO THIS COLOR TO PLAYERSWHOHAVECUT\n-
      When a card is played, REMOVE ITS COLOR FROM UNPLAYEDCOLOR\n- When a card is
      played, DECREMENT ITS COLOR''S VALUE FROM STRONGESTREMAININGCARDBYCOLOR\n\n\nRESET
      LEADING COLOR : how ?\n\n\n\n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"807bba9d-73c0-4f2d-a558-d37316c1ad90","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":833.0,"y":269.0},"guid":"d6acf602-e108-42dd-b5ee-0d2388fa72eb","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SubgraphUnit","$id":"268"},{"type":"System.Int32","value":{"$content":1,"$type":"System.Int32"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":-494.0,"y":-241.0},"guid":"22c96f5f-164f-4e96-9530-0a5c1c475a5a","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"5587"},{"kind":"Object","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"PlayerHuman","$type":"System.String"},"object":null},"position":{"x":218.0,"y":739.0},"guid":"d22077af-ae93-43a9-866d-dc71abd15801","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SetVariable","$id":"5589"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"248"},"sourceKey":"ifTrue","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"268"},"destinationKey":"In","guid":"8cb8f2c1-5ddc-49ea-b8df-083db13644e6","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"264"},"sourceKey":"assigned","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"95"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"656e08ac-c9da-45e8-8cce-4fd64f2f9e03","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"5589"},"sourceKey":"assigned","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"19"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"a1742983-fae3-4fce-91d0-ae58e200bb75","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"19"},"sourceKey":"exit","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"264"},"destinationKey":"assign","guid":"71bcc34c-67bf-4305-84ab-80670c551b5a","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"95"},"sourceKey":"exit","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"246"},"destinationKey":"assign","guid":"95ae26ee-012e-4127-9473-a99f2f241327","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"9"},"sourceKey":"trigger","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"107"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"70070c3e-dd7f-420d-ad16-85e1